    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TryAngle: Shapes Warfare</strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced, addictive shoot 'em up with a twist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't shoot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your TryAngle <strong>never stops moving -</strong> focus on dodging enemy shapes to reach the often changing check points to increase your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather power-ups</strong> to assist you on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn coins</strong> to unlock new TryAngle skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live, die, and retry!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costs as much as a \ud83c\udf6a cookie, but is fun for longer and is sugar-free!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TryAngle: Shapes Warfare</strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced, addictive shoot 'em up with a twist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't shoot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your TryAngle <strong>never stops moving -</strong> focus on dodging enemy shapes to reach the often changing check points to increase your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather power-ups</strong> to assist you on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn coins</strong> to unlock new TryAngle skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live, die, and retry!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costs as much as a \ud83c\udf6a cookie, but is fun for longer and is sugar-free!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
